      ],
      "updated": 1785664181224,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "标准的监督学习回归问题",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "标准的监督学习回归问题",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "F3fQgPDp-w6vfwnzVdZh2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 356.52737296914916,
      "y": 2117.0995871201376,
      "width": 1189.775044117395,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0N",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 601668715,
      "version": 309,
      "versionNonce": 1661748875,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785664181224,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "你让一个学生做数学题，答案本身也是由这个学生自己算出来的。每次他改了自己的解题思路（更新θ），答案也跟着变了（目标移\n动）。于是模型永远在追一个移动的靶子，梯度剧烈震荡，直接导致发散（Diverge）",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "你让一个学生做数学题，答案本身也是由这个学生自己算出来的。每次他改了自己的解题思路（更新θ），答案也跟着变了（目标移动）。于是模型永远在追一个移动的靶子，梯度剧烈震荡，直接导致发散（Diverge）",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "uLzMT63Tw-nqQ-g8efvyX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 362.59809214030815,
      "y": 2261.3164417540734,
      "width": 682.2398071289062,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0O",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1153203819,
      "version": 317,
      "versionNonce": 1853439275,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785664181224,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "核心：离线训练（Off-policy）+ 固定目标（Target）+ 随机采样（Replay）",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "核心：离线训练（Off-policy）+ 固定目标（Target）+ 随机采样（Replay）",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
